{
  "title": "重定向坑：失败写法与两种正解",
  "type": "cmd",
  "lines": [
    {"t": "cmd", "s": "sudo echo 3 > /proc/sys/vm/drop_caches"},
    {"t": "out", "s": "bash: line 1: /proc/sys/vm/drop_caches: Permission denied"},
    {"t": "note", "s": "# > 重定向由当前 shell 执行,sudo 提权的只是 echo"},
    {"t": "cmd", "s": "echo 3 | sudo tee /proc/sys/vm/drop_caches"},
    {"t": "out", "s": "3"},
    {"t": "cmd", "s": "sudo sh -c \"echo 3 > /proc/sys/vm/drop_caches\""},
    {"t": "note", "s": "# tee 或 sh -c:让\"写文件\"这个动作本身以 root 执行"},
    {"t": "note", "s": "实测环境：Rocky Linux 9.3 特权容器(失败行为以非 root 复现)"}
  ]
}
